    ($SATQ$d0a53ef5$SATQ$, $SATQ$441e80ee-d059-4eb1-b33c-69ae14eabe0e$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$f8fadec5-c815-4843-a970-5905f6731857$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.B.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables $SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 7, $SATQ$spr$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: center;"><math alttext="StartRoot left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis squared EndRoot equals StartRoot 3 x plus 34 EndRoot"><mrow>
