2 \nL 161.412191 63.309049 \nL 164.654279 42.622058 \nL 165.870062 34.542827 \nL 165.870062 34.542827 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n   </g>\n  </g>\n </g>\n <defs>\n  <clipPath id=\"p7c72648dfe\">\n   <rect height=\"260.82\" width=\"262.488358\" x=\"9.200821\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n  </clipPath>\n </defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a system of a parabola and a line\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>For the parabola in the system:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>The parabola opens upward.</li>\n<li>The vertex is at point (4 comma 1).</li>\n<li>The parabola passes through the following points:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>(3 comma 2)</li>\n<li>(4 comma 1)</li>\n<li>(5 comma 2)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>For the line in the system:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>The line is horizontal.</li>\n<li>The line passes through the following points:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>(0 comma 1)</li>\n<li>(4 comma 1)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of a system of a linear and a quadratic equation is shown. What is the solution <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to this system?</p>","keys":["346cf7e3-00cf-471d-a4c8-13b0183d6e5f"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"b6f58285-af92-4955-84c0-9d8cda27e1ec","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"30461308-3f6b-4994-a1e3-fceafc461575","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 4 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"140b7a1f-7ec3-4e09-a517-e8295cef8cf4","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma negative 1 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"346cf7e3-00cf-471d-a4c8-13b0183d6e5f","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The solution to the system corresponds to the point where the graphs of the equations intersect. The graphs of the linear equation and the quadratic equation shown intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 4 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is the solution to this system.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"8900a10b-e0a1-45fb-9e6e-fa09017b372e","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1755117017720,"updateDate":1755117017720}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1755117017720, 1755117017720),
