ue.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. The value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"a StartRoot b EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow>\n</math>, which must be negative.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. The value of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"a StartRoot b EndRoot\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t<msqrt>\n\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t</msqrt>\n</mrow>\n</math>, which could be <math alttext=\"negative 24\"><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn>\n</math>, but doesn't have to be.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1730147357400,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"d41cf4d3","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":7,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1730147357400,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"c33f8edf-4790-4382-963c-36f09a033f73","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"b5c09aa9-c407-4955-98ca-ef5ca9f09d72","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"answerOptions":[{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals 24\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p>","id":"ba9bbde6-e6eb-48be-a441-5d4c1ac7e96c"},{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals negative 24\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p>","id":"8245782c-3019-419f-b41b-8efda8a7027e"},{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"a greater than b\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p>","id":"a451f5b9-18b5-4f00-8031-83982548d262"},{"content":"<p><math alttex