	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mn>12</mn>
</mrow>
</math>, not <math alttext="12 x plus 27"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>12</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mn>27</mn>
</mrow>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext="324 x plus 27"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>324</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mn>27</mn>
</mrow>
</math>, not <math alttext="12 x plus 27"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>12</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mn>27</mn>
</mrow>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext="27 x plus 72"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>27</mn>
