</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"d8e84431","external_id":"10bfa82a-f80c-43fa-bf29-485d8932309c","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"40477a3c-8f58-4ae4-8f60-edc375878d16","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.C.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":7,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The area of a rectangular banner is <math alttext=\"2,661\"><mn>2,661</mn>\n</math> square inches. The banner's length <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, in inches, is <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> inches longer than its width, in inches. Which equation represents this situation?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"d7b45cb0-12a8-482a-b8b6-7a071da6ec14","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"ec2893a2-f81e-450e-9992-800677c328f8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x plus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7f15d45a-3b19-4381-a389-166788484fea","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared plus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"eb15959c-8789-48b2-bce6-4b7c66ec3742","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared plus 24 x plus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}],"keys":["d7b45cb0-12a8-482a-b8b6-7a071da6ec14"],"correct_answer":["A"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. It&rsquo;s given that the banner&rsquo;s length <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, in inches, is <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> inches longer than its width, in inches. It follows that the banner&rsquo;s width, in inches, can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"x minus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. The area of a rectangle is the product of its length and its width. It's given that the area of the banner is <math alttext=\"2,661\"><mn>2,661</mn>\n</math> square inches, so it follows that <math alttext=\"2,661 equals x left parenthesis x minus 24 right parenthesis\"><mrow>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mfenced>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mfenced>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>, or <math alttext=\"2,661 equals x squared minus 24 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"2,661\"><mn>2,661</mn>\n</math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the equation that represents this situation is <math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from representing the width, in inches, of the banner as <math alttext=\"24 minus x\"><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, rather than <math alttext=\"x minus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from representing the width, in inches, of the banner as <math alttext=\"x plus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, rather than <math alttext=\"x minus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554980,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"d8e84431","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":7,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1743430554980,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"10bfa82a-f80c-43fa-bf29-485d8932309c","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"40477a3c-8f58-4ae4-8f60-edc375878d16","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The area of a rectangular banner is <math alttext=\"2,661\"><mn>2,661</mn>\n</math> square inches. The banner's length <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, in inches, is <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> inches longer than its width, in inches. Which equation represents this situation?</p>","keys":["d7b45cb0-12a8-482a-b8b6-7a071da6ec14"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"d7b45cb0-12a8-482a-b8b6-7a071da6ec14","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"ec2893a2-f81e-450e-9992-800677c328f8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x plus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7f15d45a-3b19-4381-a389-166788484fea","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared plus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"eb15959c-8789-48b2-bce6-4b7c66ec3742","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0 equals x squared plus 24 x plus 2,661\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>24</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>2,661</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. It&rsquo;s given that the banner&rsquo;s length <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, in inches, is <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> inches longer than its width, in inches. It follows that the banner&rsquo;s width, in inches, can be represented by the expression <math alttext=\"x minus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. The area of a rectangle is the product of its length and its width. It's given that the area of the banner is <math alttext=\"2,661\"><mn>2,661</mn>\n</math> square inches, so it follows that <math alttext=\"2,661 equals x left parenthesis x minus 24 right parenthesis\"><mrow>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mfenced>\n<mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mfenced>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>, or <math alttext=\"2,661 equals x squared minus 24 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"2,661\"><mn>2,661</mn>\n</math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the equation that represents this situation is <math alttext=\"0 equals x squared minus 24 x minus 2,661\"><mrow>\n<mn>0</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<msup>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mn>24</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>2,661</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from representing the width, in inches, of the banner as <math alttext=\"24 minus x\"><mn>24</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, rather than <math alttext=\"x minus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from representing the width, in inches, of the banner as <math alttext=\"x plus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, rather than <math alttext=\"x minus 24\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"10bfa82a-f80c-43fa-bf29-485d8932309c","correct_answer":["A"]},"createDate":1743430554980,"updateDate":1743430554980}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554980, 1743430554980),
    ($SATQ$d9137a84$SATQ$, $SATQ$4374fa03-6222-4e03-a842-f2d7a77397bb$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$c4aab621-4e2b-47ea-8ac7-821e6e7dbb19$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.A.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Equivalent expressions$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Which expression represents the product of&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 Baseline right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis x Superscript 4 Baseline z Superscript 5 Baseline plus y Superscript 8 Baseline z Superscript negative 7 Baseline right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"91749b3c-85eb-44e9-b190-1d4a16465f47","content":"<p><math alttext=\"x Superscript negative 2 Baseline z Superscript 10 plus y Superscript 11 Baseline z Superscript negative 2\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"},{"id":"1cca956e-2267-41d7-b858-06aa7249cc66","content":"<p><math alttext=\"x Superscript negative 2 Baseline z Superscript 10 plus x Superscript negative 6 Baseline z Superscript negative 2\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"},{"id":"412239eb-6176-4f50-a70f-cd59516150b9","content":"<p><math alttext=\"x Superscript negative 2 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 10 plus y Superscript 8 Baseline z Superscript negative 7\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></msup></math></p>"},{"id":"f2b06189-276e-4bd9-82c9-98607cb2c08f","content":"<p><math alttext=\"x Superscript negative 2 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 10 plus x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y Superscript 11 Baseline z Superscript negative 2\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["f2b06189-276e-4bd9-82c9-98607cb2c08f"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is correct. The product of&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 Baseline right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis x Superscript 4 Baseline z Superscript 5 Baseline plus y Superscript 8 Baseline z Superscript negative 7 Baseline right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> can be represented by the expression&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 Baseline right parenthesis left parenthesis x Superscript 4 Baseline z Superscript 5 Baseline plus y Superscript 8 Baseline z Superscript negative 7 Baseline right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>. Applying the distributive property to this expression yields&nbsp;<math alttext="left parenthesis x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 Baseline right parenthesis left parenthesis x Superscript 4 Baseline z Superscript 5 Baseline right parenthesis plus left parenthesis x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 Baseline right parenthesis left parenthesis y Superscript 8 Baseline z Superscript negative 7 Baseline right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext="x Superscript negative 6 Baseline x Superscript 4 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 Baseline z Superscript 5 plus x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y cubed y Superscript 8 Baseline z Superscript 5 Baseline z Superscript negative 7"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math>. This expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext="x Superscript negative 6 plus 4 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 5 plus 5 plus x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y Superscript 3 plus 8 Baseline z Superscript 5 minus 7"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext="x Superscript negative 2 Baseline y cubed z Superscript 10 plus x Superscript negative 6 Baseline y Superscript 11 Baseline z Superscript negative 2"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>11</mn></msup><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>
