ng equations that yield an increasing, rather than decreasing, output value of <span class=\"italic\">f</span>(<span class=\"italic\">x</span>) when the input value of <span class=\"italic\">x</span> increases. Choice C is incorrect and may result from choosing an equation that doesn&rsquo;t yield the values in the table.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":11,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959615,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"dba7432e","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":5,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1691007959615,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"017018-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"c06be872-82d9-4be1-b1fc-5f6e44ef6dad","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"017018-DC","section":"Math","body":"<div class=\"stimulus_reference\"><table class=\"table_WithBorder tcp-11178d0a-bbd6-4727-92cd-17135268ac70\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"tcp-ca4d8494-78ff-4300-b848-3703b09287f9\"><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"italic\">x</span></span></td><td class=\"tcp-5b53cc14-8401-45b5-9507-66a4249218bd\"><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"italic\">f</span></span>(<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"italic\">x</span></span>)</td></tr><tr><td class=\"tcp-521d4d07-28b8-4daa-b77d-e0434944d475\">0</td><td class=\"tcp-5dc6d263-bc4f-4730-b2e3-ca19d275c816\">5</td></tr><tr><td class=\"tcp-84c9dcf9-429a-4726-94c0-4107ab20e051\">1</td><td class=\"tcp-88de162c-2093-4e1a-a8b1-65cd689a2425\"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"five halves\"></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tcp-ee7c5afd-a559-4f13-a01c-ccfd49057622\">2</td><td class=\"tcp-fa424496-8a6e-4daf-a749-150da6a81bbf\"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"dat