ibn":"","external_id":"ba751bc0-12b0-41ac-9d53-b1375e5b11f4","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"dc288756-adef-4214-a657-7c7e8b5bd30a","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>56</mn></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>?</p>","keys":["46e3ec23-79e4-43d5-bb6b-df04948e3b54"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"b41fa9c2-7647-4863-88eb-b003ff750bc6","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 t s left parenthesis 16 s squared minus 14 t s right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"11388226-41d9-4671-b6b5-65936eaefcb3","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 t s left parenthesis 16 t squared s squared minus 14 t right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"33268928-81c4-4a05-8e09-3d51cd022e7e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 t squared s left parenthesis 16 t s minus 14 s right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"46e3ec23-79e4-43d5-bb6b-df04948e3b54","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4 t squared s left parenthesis 16 s squared minus 14 t right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. For the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;is a common factor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"56\"><mn>56</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"t squared\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is a common factor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"t squared\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"t cubed\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi></math> is a common factor of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"s cubed\"><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi></math>. It follows that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 t squared s\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math> is a common factor of each term in the given expression. Factoring out&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 t squared s\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math> from each term in the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 t squared s left parenthesis 16 s squared minus 14 t right parenthesis\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"4 t squared s left parenthesis 16 s squared minus 14 t right parenthesis\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equivalent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t s cubed minus 56 t squared s squared\"><mn>64</mn><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t cubed s cubed minus 56 t squared s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t cubed s squared minus 56 t squared s squared\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"64 t squared s cubed minus 56 t cubed s\"><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>s</mi></math>.</p>","externalid":"ba751bc0-12b0-41ac-9d53-b1375e5b11f4","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1776362727993,"updateDate":1776362727993}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1776362727993, 1776362727993)
